{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Allow people aged 14-15 to be able to get a motorcycle permit license",
        "additional_details": "This petition asks the Government to introduce a restricted 50cc motorcycle permit for 14\u201315-year-olds. Applicants would need approved training and testing, with a parent or guardian who has held a motorcycle licence for at least 5 years attending the test and approving the motorcycle purchase. Permit holders would ride without supervision but have no passengers, no night riding, and must wear certified protective gear.",
        "background": "Allow 14\u201315-year-olds to obtain a restricted 50cc motorcycle permit after approved training and testing. They must attend their test with a parent/guardian who has held a motorcycle licence for 5+ years. No passengers or night riding; certified gear required, with parent/guardian approval to buy.",
